    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Crŏmyon</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cremmyon</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 7, 11,
